<!-- 216, library A (doors to 213, 217 and, behind the bookshelf, 218).

     Door 2 to 218, the hidden library, sits behind bookshelf object 0,
     which init puts in front of it at x 4732 until 218 has been entered
     (scenario 0x4F, set by 218's init on the second visit), and on its
     spot at x 2532 after. AOT 6 (SCE_USEITEM, SAT_UNDER | SAT_OBJECT) is
     an object probe on that spot: each tick, after the room's main pass,
     it sets room flag 0x18 while the shelf stands on it. On the second
     mansion visit main runs every tick: it reads 0x18, clears it, and
     turns door 2 on while it was set, off while it was clear. So the door
     is live only while the shelf stands on the spot; nothing marks that
     but the pulse and, once 218 was entered, scenario 0x4F.

     218 holds nothing the story needs: 15 handgun rounds, ink ribbons and
     the heliport seen from the window (scenario 0x60, which no other room
     reads), so the bot leaves the shelf alone. (On the first visit main
     leaves door 2 alone, but 218's init then sets no door back to 216.)
     A push does work on the second visit, for a later route that wants
     the rounds: <push object="0" slot="6" axis="x" bank="0" bit="0x4F"
     after_bank="0" after_bit="0x00">, from the south end of the shelf's
     east face (a wall box, x 6354..8316 from z 15336, stands behind the
     rest: it needs stand lines five sixths of the half depth out, past
     nav.lua's PUSH_LATERALS), done also at 0x4F since init's spot, x 2532,
     is short of the middle half of the probe's zone. Tried on seed 1 it
     took the detour (about 1200 ticks) and the sandwich run then ended on
     an empty frontier, the MO disk in 217 never fitting the inventory.

     The <reach> keeps the planner off door 2 while the shelf is not on
     its spot: in the room the probe's room flag decides, from elsewhere
     scenario 0x4F. Without it the bot walked back from far away to try
     the door and gave up on every approach, over and over. -->
<bot format="2">
  <reach slot="2" bank="0" bit="0x4F" while="set" here_bank="4" here_bit="0x18"
         label="the door to 218 is live only while the bookshelf stands on its spot"/>
</bot>
